    quality.para("All six bulk ZIP files match the release's published MD5 and byte counts. Title, abstract and direct filing-date fields are nonempty for all 7,813 selected grants. Current CPC is present for 7,807; the six exceptions are genuine reissues and are retained. At-issue CPC is unavailable for 267 early NVIDIA grants, so its comparative sensitivity uses paired records rather than treating absence as a technology zero.")
    quality.table(read("patents_without_current_cpc"))
    quality.para("No negative, unparseable or greater-than-30-year grant lags occur in the Qualcomm negative-grant timing cohort. Source rows, raw CPC records and original classifier values remain available. Missing current CPC is not filled with inferred codes, and text/classifier disagreements are not relabeled.")
